      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蓝靛果送到的第二天，我遇到了北港火山。\n我走近，想告诉她农场主很高兴的事――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22e9a2e051ce45c8320583dee62a0214e1bcfbe0760e7594c896b4ea8721ed5",
