      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔ー……怎么总是不顺利呢。\n是因为苫小牧宣传跟清纯可爱人设不搭配吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b07dbdd8ced856648b467fba20c2d62c8abf74b5cc59fd32537dda0ea383fd4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
